## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design cross-cloud, multi-tenant OTCA pipelines with governance and schema contracts.

## Key Concepts

- Federated schema registry with per-tenant Protobuf contracts
- Forward/backward compatibility and versioning
- Tenant isolation via topic scoping and ACLs
- Cross-cloud replication and data deletion/retention governance
- Observability and testing strategies

## Code Example

```protobuf
syntax = "proto3";
package otca;
message TelemetryEvent {
  string tenant_id = 1;
  string service_id = 2;
  string event_type = 3;
  int64 timestamp = 4;
  int32 latency_ms = 5;
  string model_version = 6;
}
```

